<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>纽约时报 &amp;gt; 美国 &amp;gt; 政治</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/spotlight/on-politics</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 22:21:17 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>关于人工智能的严厉警告会影响中期选举吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/11/us/politics/midterm-elections-trump-ai.html</link><description>人工智能研究人员的严厉警告在全国引起反响。</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 22:21:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/11/us/politics/midterm-elections-trump-ai.html</guid></item><item><title>特朗普有多关心谁赢得中期选举？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/09/us/politics/trump-midterm-strategy.html</link><description>特朗普总统的大会已在达拉斯开幕，因此我们请玛吉·哈伯曼帮助理解他的中期战略。</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 22:39:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/09/us/politics/trump-midterm-strategy.html</guid></item><item><title>关于特朗普阻止邮寄选票的努力需要了解什么</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/04/us/politics/trump-mail-in-ballots-voting-midterms-elections.html</link><description>距选举日不到两个月，我们对拟议的变更和法庭挑战进行了整理。</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 21:24:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/04/us/politics/trump-mail-in-ballots-voting-midterms-elections.html</guid></item><item><title>中期选举，Nepo-Baby 攻击会奏效吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/02/us/politics/midterms-nepo-baby-shaheen.html</link><description>一位新罕布什尔州参议员的女儿正在竞选公职，却发现自己的名字被用来对付她。</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 22:55:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/02/us/politics/midterms-nepo-baby-shaheen.html</guid></item><item><title>斯科特·布朗是共和党明星。这在新罕布什尔州参议院竞选中重要吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/31/us/politics/new-hampshire-senate-scott-brown.html</link><description>斯科特·布朗（Scott Brown）通过一场看似即兴的参议院竞选活动再次追逐政治聚光灯。</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 22:17:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/31/us/politics/new-hampshire-senate-scott-brown.html</guid></item><item><title>现在是特朗普的首都，但选民并不住在那里</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/28/us/politics/trump-washington-dc-capital-voters.html</link><description>他对重塑华盛顿的痴迷可能会在政治上损害他的政党。</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 14:32:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/28/us/politics/trump-washington-dc-capital-voters.html</guid></item><item><title>特朗普如何将格雷厄姆家族王朝纳入自己的王朝</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/26/us/politics/trump-lindsey-graham-darline-graham.html</link><description>总统将林赛和达林·格雷厄姆视为他自己政治遗产的一部分。</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 15:48:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/26/us/politics/trump-lindsey-graham-darline-graham.html</guid></item><item><title>特朗普在南卡罗来纳州参议院决选中对达林·格雷厄姆的支持是否足够？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/trump-darline-graham-south-carolina-runoff.html</link><description>总统在一位参议员的妹妹身上下了很大的赌注。</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 21:39:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/trump-darline-graham-south-carolina-runoff.html</guid></item><item><title>美国结束了闪电般的初选和政治快速约会的夏季</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/21/us/politics/midterm-primaries-south-carolina-wisconsin-michigan.html</link><description>几个州的情节曲折导致了快速的比赛，与传统的美国马拉松比赛相比，这些比赛感觉更让人想起欧洲式的快速比赛。</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 21:17:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/21/us/politics/midterm-primaries-south-carolina-wisconsin-michigan.html</guid></item><item><title>更多特朗普选择的候选人在共和党初选中失利</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/19/us/politics/trump-primary-election-republican-endorsements.html</link><description>最近的一系列失利削弱了总统的获胜记录，引发了人们对他对党选民的控制力的新质疑。</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 20:20:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/19/us/politics/trump-primary-election-republican-endorsements.html</guid></item></channel></rss>